          <p>Tero is designed to surface the right node to the right person at the right moment. A second-year ICU nurse would describe what she is seeing, and Tero would match her to the nodes of nurses who navigated the same threshold.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Connected sequence, same pattern as the site's capture steps -->
        <ol class="mt-10">
